{"seq":19,"slug":"supply-chain-management","title":"供应链管理","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"供应链管理\">供应链管理</h1><p>供应链管理（Supply Chain Management, SCM）覆盖从原材料采购到终端交付的全链路协调与优化。2026 年，地缘政治波动、AI 技术爆发、ESG 合规趋严三股力量叠加，供应链正从&quot;成本驱动&quot;范式转向&quot;价值驱动 + 韧性优先&quot;范式。本 hub 聚焦于供应链的体系设计、计划执行、技术赋能与战略决策四个维度，帮助开发者理解如何用系统工程思维构建和优化现代供应链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 关注供应链管理的<strong>体系性框架</strong>——从需求计划、采购、库存到全局战略决策，属于&quot;链主/供应链部门&quot;视角。与之区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../ecommerce-logistics/\">电商物流</a>侧重仓储、配送、末端履约等物流执行层，是供应链的物理搬运环节。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ecommerce-operations/\">电商运营</a>侧重店铺经营、订单流转、促销策略，是供应链下游的需求触发端。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../cross-border-ecommerce/\">跨境电商</a>聚焦跨国场景下的合规、清关、海外仓，是供应链在全球化语境中的特殊形态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 提供的是贯穿上下游的&quot;指挥中枢&quot;视角：如何做计划、选供应商、配库存、定源策略、建控制塔、评估韧性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-7 年经验的开发者，建议按以下顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>（foundations）——先建立供应链架构的心智模型，理解需求计划和采购的核心逻辑。</li>\n<li><strong>物流篇</strong>（logistics）——从库存管理、仓网设计到运输调度，掌握供应链物理执行层的关键决策。</li>\n<li><strong>技术篇</strong>（technology）——了解 AI、数字孪生、控制塔等 2026 年前沿工具如何改变供应链运作方式。</li>\n<li><strong>战略篇</strong>（strategy）——从近岸外包、韧性设计到 ESG 合规，把视野拉到供应链的全局战略层。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果对某一模块有明确需求（如正在做供应链系统的技术选型），可以直接进入技术篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的业务流程概念（订单、库存、采购）</li>\n<li>了解电商业务的基本运作模式（可先阅读电商运营 hub）</li>\n<li>对分布式系统有初步认识（有助于理解供应链信息系统）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"供应链基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-architecture","title":"供应链网络架构与参考模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/supply-chain-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-planning-forecasting","title":"需求计划与预测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/demand-planning-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"procurement-supplier-management","title":"采购与供应商管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/procurement-supplier-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics","title":"供应链物流管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-management-optimization","title":"库存管理与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/inventory-management-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-distribution-network","title":"仓配网络与分销设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/warehouse-distribution-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-freight-management","title":"运输与货运管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/transportation-freight-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology","title":"供应链技术赋能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-driven-supply-chain","title":"AI 驱动的智能供应链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/ai-driven-supply-chain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-twin-simulation","title":"数字孪生与供应链仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/digital-twin-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-visibility-platform","title":"供应链可视化控制塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/supply-chain-visibility-platform"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy","title":"供应链战略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nearshoring-sourcing-strategy","title":"近岸外包与全球源策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/nearshoring-sourcing-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-resilience","title":"供应链韧性与风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/supply-chain-resilience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"esg-sustainable-supply-chain","title":"ESG 与可持续供应链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/esg-sustainable-supply-chain"}]}]}